OL,3,GNEWSAThree charged over attempted      
OL,4,Amurder of man                          
OL,6,FThree people have been charged in      
OL,7,Fconnection with the attempted murder of
OL,8,Fa man in Aberdeen.                     
OL,10,FThe 42-year-old was taken to hospital  
OL,11,Ffollowing an incident on Seaview Road  
OL,12,Fin the Bridge of Don area at about     
OL,13,F09:00 on Friday.                       
OL,15,FA 46-year-old woman and two men, aged  
OL,16,F36 and 48, have been charged over the  
OL,17,Fincident.                              
OL,19,FA third man, 50, has also been         
OL,20,Farrested. Police Scotland said         
OL,21,Finquiries were ongoing.                
